                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1741118806217-1f38e2faa6be?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw4fHx3cml0aW5nJTIwam91cm5hbCUyMGRlc2t8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc4Mjg1OTg0Mnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>高考出分季，如果没考上本科，可能反而是好事。]]></description></item><item><title>怎么大胆地做选择</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%81%9A%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 22:52:53 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%81%9A%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1752859696474-69016d60ab5a?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw0fHx3ZWVrbHklMjBqb3VybmFsJTIwbGlmZSUyMGNpdHl8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc4MjM0MTcwOHww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>大多数选择都是可逆的，不必让每一个都背负全部重量。想清预期与风险、听听别人的视角，然后跟着直觉走；再给自己一条2%的止损线，就能勇敢地大量做选择，在选择中把自己塑造成该有的样子。]]></description></item><item><title>买学区房最难的，是不能什么都要</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E4%B9%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%8C%BA%E6%88%BF%E6%9C%80%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84-%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%83%BD%E8%A6%81/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 22:42:21 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E4%B9%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%8C%BA%E6%88%BF%E6%9C%80%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84-%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%83%BD%E8%A6%81/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626178793926-22b28830aa30?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyfHxob21lJTIwbW9ydGdhZ2UlMjBjaXR5fGVufDF8MHx8fDE3ODE3MzYzOTF8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>两个孩子下半年就要上幼儿园了。想到学区房需要好好挑挑，所以预先看起来了。但对于学区房我又很犹豫。买肯定要买，但是买什么样的，却一直想不清楚。]]></description></item><item><title>给自己做了个Skill</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E6%88%91%E5%92%8Cai--%E7%BB%99%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%81%9A%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%AAskill/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 22:45:02 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E6%88%91%E5%92%8Cai--%E7%BB%99%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%81%9A%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%AAskill/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618393678108-820a9d6e41ed?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw2fHx3cml0aW5nJTIwam91cm5hbCUyMGRlc2t8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc4MTA0NTEwN3ww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>当知识获取成本趋近于零，什么才是人与人之间真正的分水岭？用一个从剪藏到水墨屏 EPUB 的亲身经历，聊聊「Skill」在 AI 时代的价值。]]></description></item><item><title>真正花时间的，是让AI认识你</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E6%88%91%E5%92%8Cai--%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E8%8A%B1%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84-%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9ai%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E4%BD%A0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 22:39:39 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E6%88%91%E5%92%8Cai--%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E8%8A%B1%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84-%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9ai%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E4%BD%A0/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442135136-760c813028c0?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw4fHxhcnRpZmljaWFsJTIwaW50ZWxsaWdlbmNlJTIwdGVjaG5vbG9neXxlbnwxfDB8fHwxNzgxMDQ1MTA4fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>我搭了一个属于自己的 AI 助手，用了一段时间后，最深的感受不是激动，而是沉浸。]]></description></item><item><title>五一带娃港珠澳 3-香港</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3-3-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3-3-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622395494436-398c13b3854a?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyfHx0cmF2ZWwlMjBjaXR5JTIwbGFuZHNjYXBlfGVufDF8MHx8fDE3Nzk4MzYzNTV8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>从澳门回来以后，在珠海休整了一天，然后我们准备去香港。从珠海到香港最方便的方式，就是通过港珠澳大桥坐巴士前往。 差不多 40 分钟的车程，在这一条长]]></description></item><item><title>五一带娃港珠澳 2-澳门</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3-2-%E6%BE%B3%E9%97%A8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 22:45:19 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3-2-%E6%BE%B3%E9%97%A8/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597398443854-655222471d89?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxMHx8dHJhdmVsJTIwY2l0eSUyMGxhbmRzY2FwZXxlbnwxfDB8fHwxNzc5MjMwOTg5fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>这趟珠海之行，本来就计划把香港澳门一起走了。尤其是第一天发现珠海人太多，感觉也没啥好玩的了。 从珠海到澳门有好几个口岸可以过去，大多数人的选择]]></description></item><item><title>五一带娃港珠澳1-珠海</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B31-%E7%8F%A0%E6%B5%B7/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 22:27:40 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%80%E6%B8%B8--%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%A6%E5%A8%83%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B31-%E7%8F%A0%E6%B5%B7/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1776942541694-89d53eff2e06?ixid=M3w5NTI2NTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw4fHx0cmF2ZWwlMjBjaXR5JTIwbGFuZHNjYXBlfGVufDF8MHx8fDE3Nzg5MTkyODV8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div>这个五一，我们去了珠海。从 1 号出发，5 号回来，中间还分别去了一趟澳门和香港。我、老婆、我妈，带着两个小孩，算是完成了一次长途旅游的挑战。我们]]></description></item></channel></rss>